{"parse": {"title": "9TH-12", "pageid": 97017, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-11\" title=\"9TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-13\" title=\"9TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.B0.E5.89.8D.EF.BC.8C.E5.B9.95.E5.90.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"台前，幕后\">台前，幕后</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 台前，幕后</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Behind the Operating Curtain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>断<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>代<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>紊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span><br /><span class=\"color-value\"></span>匍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>匐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>废<span class=\"color-value\"></span>墟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>：<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>疯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>癫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10912</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看似整洁的室内密布着细小的划痕和难以辨别的污渍，令人感到压抑。<br />空气中弥漫着微弱的消毒水味道，其中混杂着潮湿的霉气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>请诸位在此稍等片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>梅林先生应当正在忙碌中。就诸位的拜访诉求，我会将情况完整地向他汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我不能保证梅林先生一定会接见各位，但……我会尽力让他改变主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>美洲豹的身影无声息地消失在办公室内间的门后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>现在是个好时机，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，您的意思是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>想让狱卒小姐批准我们搜查瞭望塔并不是一件易事。我觉得我们应该主动出击，寻找任何有用的线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我明白了，司辰……我会尽力的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手迅速开始了违规的搜查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>感谢你的协助，虚构集小姐。如果不是你所展现的神奇预测，我们很难说服狱卒小姐改变主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>虽然我仍未弄明白这一切如何与骰子、与你的小说扯上联系，但——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>哪怕是根据排除法，我们也几乎可以断定：你的笔友阿莱夫就在这扇门的背后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……有时候，我很佩服你的果断，维尔汀。我想应该有很多人和你说过，你是一个很特别的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你还好吗？看起来你似乎不如刚刚进入监狱那般兴奋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚构集看向紧闭的大门，她并不确定自己是否希望它会在下一秒打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>如果那个在瞭望塔中操纵一切的视线真的是阿莱夫——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这是一个可怕的猜想，我暂时还不知道该怎么去面对它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>很抱歉打断了你们的谈话——但司辰，我想您需要看看这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>落款兀尔德——这是德洛丝女士留下的信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻盈的签名字迹，同稿件收纳册上的一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>她的字迹和我想象中一样漂亮。这封信是写给谁的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>“阿莱夫阁下亲启”……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，这是德洛丝女士与阿莱夫来往的信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“敬爱的阿莱夫阁下亲启。初次通信，冒昧叨扰。我是科马拉监狱中的囚犯之一，名叫德洛丝。如今，我以笔名‘兀尔德’来信，向您请教问题。”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>“我从狱医梅林先生那儿听说——”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>您能回答人们向您询问的所有问题。类似的说法，理想家与其他囚犯的只言片语中同样有所耳闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>您是科马拉监狱的典狱长，是隐秘的投资者，还是隐藏在背后的权力意志？您真的是科马拉的至高存在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们迫不及待地将下一封信拆开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311321.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311321.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>敬爱的兀尔德女士：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311321.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311321.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>恐怕这些猜测都不准确，我不过是一名选择自囚于此的囚徒罢了。然而，既然您有疑问，我确实可以作答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311321.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311321.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>且允许我先指出一项事实：您的身份并不如您自称那般普通。您是科马拉的囚犯，也是重塑之手的客人。是什么让您对监狱中的一切起了兴趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>德洛丝女士是重塑之手的……客人？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然之间，器皿碎裂的声响打断了书信的阅读。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这是门后传来的声音……怎么回事？他们还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>狱卒小姐——狱医先生——！请问里面发生了什么事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大门一如既往地沉默着，执行着封锁与扭曲的意志，无人应答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们也许发生了什么意外。我们直接进去看看吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>并未上锁的大门通向了一个破旧而压抑的小房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张冰冷的手术台摆放在房间中央，四周堆满了零散的药品与医疗器具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想，我们也许误入了狱医的工作地点……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我早该想到的，狱医的工作地点……但这种鬼地方是手术室？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这里简直是这座监狱中最怪异的地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狭窄的手术室内，突如其来的闯入者让美洲豹惊慌失措起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>你们怎么能私自闯进来？我不是告诉过诸位，请在外面等候吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我们只是在担心你的情况，狱卒小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>别说了，快离开这里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>安静！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_zuoshoushu\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_zuoshoushu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_zuoshoushu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>在一开始，&lt;glitch&gt;爬虫脑&lt;/glitch&gt;[Reptilian Complex]主导着一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>我们像所有的爬虫与鸟类一样，遵循着典型的本能生存：心跳、呼吸、攻击、逃跑，拥有了领地与等级意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>进化使我们获得了&lt;glitch&gt;边缘系统&lt;/glitch&gt;[Limbic System]。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>它处理着我们的行为与记忆，使我们产生对快乐的追求，同时带来了恐惧、痛苦、忧虑与愤怒。一切得以被蒙上意志的色彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>在最后，却是&lt;glitch&gt;新皮质&lt;/glitch&gt;[Neocortex]占据了我们脑容量的三分之二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>语言与感知、逻辑推理、抽象的能力，构成了人性与行为的多维。我们阅读创作，认知世界与自我，定下一个又一个的目标——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>而这一切，不过都发生在颅骨内的方寸之地中，在这弯曲拥挤的脑皮层里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他是在……做手术？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>一个精密的、让人迷惑的、容易损坏的器官……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>如果它再也不能遗忘，它会变成什么模样——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>这个巴掌大的房间，能同时容纳数十个人吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，狱医放下了组织剪与持针器，昭示着手术的结束。<br />然而破旧冰冷的机器也同时发出警告，生命的曲线正在逐渐拉直。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>台上的病人，他……发生了什么事情？他看起来不太好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人回答她急切的问话。屏幕上，最后一丝波浪形的室颤与室扑也消失了，室内只余恒长的警报声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>手术，失败了吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>荒谬！手术当然成功了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>我帮助他消除了令他困苦的癔症，同时光复了科马拉监狱的秩序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>你们闯入这里想干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手术台后的男子看向不请自来的访客，但并没有给她们回答的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>算了，下一台手术马上就要开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>狱卒，马上带她们出去。15分钟后将下一位病患带进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……很抱歉，但维尔汀小姐，请你们现在就离开吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她上前一步，拦在了众人的面前，语气几乎是恳求的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>拜托了，只需要一分钟的时间！我有非常重要的事情问你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的提问还未成形，就被狱医毫不留情地打断了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>重要？没有什么比我在科马拉所做的实验更重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>外来者们，为了维持实验的长久进行，&lt;glitch&gt;时间&lt;/glitch&gt;的稳定性必须超越一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>科马拉的实验……？！科马拉监狱的幕后控制者，果然就是你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>控制者？真是一个老旧而幼稚的说法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>一切都是自发的、非个性化的权力，由谁来行使根本无关紧要。控制者无处不在，却从不使用物质手段——建筑本身才是维系一切的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>所有人都是那个匿名的观察者，而科马拉监狱不过是一个模版罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>一旦我验证了这种模式的可行，只需要做一些必要的修改，它就能套用在任何职能的场所中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>它是如此的优越、如此的有效，如此具有超凡的价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>……该死，我根本没有必要和你探讨这一切。剩下的时间已经不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员敏锐地察觉到了其中的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>梅林先生，您一直在强调的“时间”，指的究竟是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>就连那群丧失了全部理智的面具脑袋都知晓——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>时代的终点马上要到来了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>果然如此——那个呼之欲出的词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>梅林先生，您知晓“<i><b>暴雨</b></i>”的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>这就是你们的叫法吗——一场冲刷一切的“暴雨”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>来自圣洛夫基金会的职员，你们应该比我更为明了，很快，这里的一切都将不复存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>长时间的稳定观察已成奢望。我需要在这个监狱变成一片废墟或者更加不可理喻的事物之前，证明全景监狱的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>带走一切的“暴雨”……维尔汀，你们究竟在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话题发展的方向逐渐超越了一名自诩想象力丰富的作家的想象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>没人能预测我们会回到什么年代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>我见证着这片土地一次又一次回到过去，这座监狱不断改变模样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>但在九次所谓的“暴雨”中，无论我们返回到何种年代，考迪罗主义的幽灵从未离开过这片土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>无论是古典的依附论学家，还是殉难的救赎者，我都见识过了——年轻的作家，你与那些被雨水带走的知识分子没什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>……这个时代的浪潮，它疯狂、激进、残暴、魔幻，里面没有什么所谓的浪漫，只有困兽的剧烈挣扎，一轮又一轮循环的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>只有在这个被流放的边陲，我们能稍微远离野心者的掠夺与他们所带来的混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>虽然很快，那些戴面具的家伙就要把这里洗劫一空了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>就像在此之前，在这片如银子般富饶的土地上，已经发生过无数次的掠夺那般……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他自言自语着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>但没关系，即使在一片废墟之中，我们仍能拯救我们自己……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>只要我赶在所有人之前，寻找到那条通往超限的道路，这一切都会迎来答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>够了，请你们离开！我已经在你们身上浪费了过多的时间！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱医转过身去，开始为下一场手术做准备，整理那些残破不堪的手术工具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>事已至此，请诸位不要再纠缠了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我知晓你的意思了，先生。你不想再跟我讨论我的小说，我也不会再多提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>那些书信的往来，那些振奋人心的修改建议……也许对你来说都没有意义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音在颤抖。<br />退稿、闭门羹、激烈的批评——这比她所经历的那一切都要更加令她怅然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但我仍有一件事必须要告知你。狱卒小姐，你能让我们和狱医先生单独谈话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>和……阿莱夫先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，背对着众人的狱医停下了手中的动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>狱卒，你先出去吧。让我和访客单独谈话五分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>美洲豹沉默地离开了手术室，不属于大型捕食者的悲伤目光最后望了女孩们一眼。<br />这一次，她什么也没有回应。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-12"}}